WEBVTT

00:10:28.874 --> 00:10:30.125
from the root systems.

00:10:30.584 --> 00:10:32.336
That’s what is going to control --

00:10:32.378 --> 00:10:36.715
that’s what is going to reduce the amount
of nitrogen fertilizer in future ...

00:10:36.757 --> 00:10:38.717
in wheat root systems.

00:10:39.218 --> 00:10:40.427
Thank you.

00:10:40.427 --> 00:10:46.725
(Applause)